1086
01:06:52,170 --> 01:06:53,350
Which means I've been here.

1087
01:06:53,910 --> 01:06:54,310
Right?

1088
01:06:57,530 --> 01:07:00,390
That could be an indicator that I'm on the right path.

1089
01:07:01,650 --> 01:07:02,490
I just realized.

1090
01:07:04,110 --> 01:07:04,470
Oh!

1091
01:07:08,150 --> 01:07:09,390
We found it!

1092
01:07:09,990 --> 01:07:10,730
There it is.

1093
01:07:10,950 --> 01:07:12,090
Unless it's a new one.

1094
01:07:13,150 --> 01:07:14,070
I doubt that, though.

1095
01:07:14,190 --> 01:07:15,230
This has to be the same one, right?

1096
01:07:17,990 --> 01:07:18,650
Very nice.

1097
01:07:19,010 --> 01:07:20,150
And it was near the mushrooms.

1098
01:07:20,310 --> 01:07:20,470
Look!

1099
01:07:21,750 --> 01:07:23,170
Let me see what biome that is.

1100
01:07:24,370 --> 01:07:25,250
Okay, so birch.

1101
01:07:26,030 --> 01:07:31,310
Birchy biome and mushrooms.

1102
01:07:35,730 --> 01:07:36,790
And we got music.

1103
01:07:36,910 --> 01:07:37,570
Is this new music?

1104
01:07:42,060 --> 01:07:43,320
That's a nice view right there.

1105
01:07:43,620 --> 01:07:43,860
Look at that.

1106
01:07:44,880 --> 01:07:46,640
Kind of reminds me of Grand Theft Auto 6.

1107
01:07:49,000 --> 01:07:49,960
The red sky.

1108
01:07:51,380 --> 01:07:54,920
Man, I can't wait to play that game when it's fully out, you know?

1109
01:07:56,380 --> 01:07:57,560
On PC and all that.

1110
01:07:58,340 --> 01:08:00,300
Gonna play it at a thousand frames per second.

1111
01:08:00,840 --> 01:08:01,940
On a NASA computer.

1112
