1114
01:08:16,080 --> 01:08:17,820
I saw something move.

1115
01:08:17,920 --> 01:08:18,720
Wait, why are there so many?

1116
01:08:19,580 --> 01:08:20,440
Is that because... Wait.

1117
01:08:20,960 --> 01:08:22,320
Are they attracted to the hotel?

1118
01:08:23,560 --> 01:08:24,420
I never noticed.

1119
01:08:26,860 --> 01:08:28,820
Maybe the Endermen are attracted to this place.

1120
01:08:32,440 --> 01:08:33,500
Yeah, this is new music.

1121
01:08:34,340 --> 01:08:35,560
I've not heard this track before.

1122
01:08:37,200 --> 01:08:39,560
