1123
01:08:41,000 --> 01:08:44,640
Even after all these... years, actually, I could say at this point.

1124
01:08:52,840 --> 01:08:53,940
Oh, yeah, I need you.

1125
01:08:58,600 --> 01:08:59,240
You know what?

1126
