We should plop down a bed here.

1127
01:09:02,900 --> 01:09:03,920
Play things safe.

1128
01:09:06,800 --> 01:09:08,420
I do not want to die now.

1129
01:09:09,640 --> 01:09:12,400
That would be the worst thing to happen.

1130
01:09:21,860 --> 01:09:22,540
Thank you.

1131
01:09:23,840 --> 01:09:25,340
Okay, they've got pumpkins here.

1132
01:09:28,280 --> 01:09:29,460
That's maybe a good sign.

1133
01:09:29,700 --> 01:09:30,980
Means they're into vegetables.

1134
01:09:33,120 --> 01:09:34,620
Even though pumpkins are fruits.

1135
01:09:38,360 --> 01:09:39,020
Just kidding.

1136
01:09:39,400 --> 01:09:40,160
Are they actually?

1137
01:09:40,280 --> 01:09:40,740
Maybe they are.

1138
01:09:41,380 --> 01:09:44,140
It's always the fruit items you least suspect.

1139
01:09:45,040 --> 01:09:45,640
You know?

1140
01:09:45,860 --> 01:09:47,720
Turn out to be vegetables and vice versa.

1141
01:09:53,840 --> 01:09:55,100
Yo, this song is nice.

1142
01:10:06,300 --> 01:10:07,040
Okay, guys.

1143
01:10:07,800 --> 01:10:11,380
I'm gonna say from this line right here, now we're on hotel grounds.

1144
01:10:11,820 --> 01:10:17,380
If I find a carrot within these premises, then it counts.

1145
01:10:18,720 --> 01:10:20,720
I think there's a carrot in here, 100%.

1146
01:10:20,720 --> 01:10:24,060
The doubters have no idea what they're talking about.

1147
01:10:25,460 --> 01:10:26,260
I'm telling you.

1148
01:10:32,680 --> 01:10:35,380
Now we gotta play this slow because these guys are actually dangerous.

1149
01:10:42,140 --> 01:10:43,300
The guys with the axes.

1150
01:10:47,540 --> 01:10:49,180
We should definitely light this place.

1151
01:10:49,500 --> 01:10:51,740
I mean, we're gonna steal the hotel... eventually.

1152
01:10:52,160 --> 01:10:54,920
So we cannot... Oh, that's not gonna catch fire, is it?

1153
01:10:56,860 --> 01:10:58,820
I was about to say, let's not burn down the place.

1154
01:11:01,680 --> 01:11:02,600
There he is!

1155
