I don't like the fact that I hear people going... If I get caught in a corner, I may be in trouble.

1162
01:11:31,330 --> 01:11:32,530
Yo, what is this music?

1163
01:11:32,890 --> 01:11:34,210
Is this creative music?

1164
01:11:35,810 --> 01:11:36,870
They have a jail!

1165
01:11:38,130 --> 01:11:40,470
Oh, wait.

1166
01:11:41,550 --> 01:11:43,310
They have redstone shit here!

1167
01:11:45,130 --> 01:11:45,690
Whoa!

1168
01:11:48,470 --> 01:11:49,490
What the hell?

1169
01:11:54,960 --> 01:11:55,620
Okay.

1170
01:11:57,620 --> 01:11:58,780
Never seen that.

1171
01:12:00,540 --> 01:12:01,460
Bath house?

1172
01:12:04,100 --> 01:12:05,140
Come at me, then.

1173
01:12:11,100 --> 01:12:12,820
Oh, it's like a forge area.

1174
01:12:14,360 --> 01:12:15,240
That's cute.

1175
01:12:20,040 --> 01:12:23,020
Alright, let's check out the other side and then we go up one stage.

1176
01:12:25,240 --> 01:12:27,640
By the way, this place is like so easy when you have a bow.

1177
01:12:29,680 --> 01:12:33,080
The bow completely nullifies every enemy in here.

1178
01:12:35,040 --> 01:12:36,480
Any threat, eliminate it.

1179
01:12:37,260 --> 01:12:37,620
Immediately.

1180
01:12:43,960 --> 01:12:44,800
There's a guy in there.

1181
01:12:46,760 --> 01:12:48,120
I know you're in here.

1182
01:12:49,160 --> 01:12:50,160
Actually kind of scary.

1183
01:12:57,720 --> 01:12:58,800
I can hear them moving.

1184
01:13:05,520 --> 01:13:07,560
Wait, I guess they're all empty.

1185
01:13:09,460 --> 01:13:13,280
Dude, I kind of like their design here on, you know, storing their chests.

1186
01:13:14,320 --> 01:13:15,440
I may steal that.

1187
01:13:16,940 --> 01:13:18,700
Or at least make my own version of that.

1188
01:13:19,440 --> 01:13:20,400
Ooh, I see you!

1189
01:13:22,260 --> 01:13:23,200
Oh, crap.

1190
01:13:24,260 --> 01:13:25,300
Oh, you're fast, huh?

1191
01:13:26,520 --> 01:13:27,460
Not fast enough.

1192
01:13:39,870 --> 01:13:41,590
Dude, it sounds like they're right on top of me.

1193
01:13:44,990 --> 01:13:49,730
Okay, they got mel... They got melons.

1194
01:13:52,050 --> 01:13:53,030
No carrots yet.

1195
01:13:55,390 --> 01:13:56,410
Pumpkins and melons.

1196
01:13:56,510 --> 01:13:57,470
Come on, they must have carrots.

1197
01:13:58,330 --> 01:14:00,410
They seem to be cultivating all kinds of crap here.

1198
01:14:06,550 --> 01:14:07,350
Yeah, I see you.

1199
01:14:08,150 --> 01:14:09,890
Okay, okay, okay, okay, okay, come on.

1200
01:14:12,690 --> 01:14:13,850
Oh my god, they're fast.

1201
01:14:25,650 --> 01:14:26,830
Okay, what are they farming here?

1202
01:14:28,310 --> 01:14:28,650
Mushrooms?

1203
01:14:31,090 --> 01:14:32,390
Okay, we're not quite there yet.

1204
01:14:32,510 --> 01:14:33,530
Come on, carrots, where are you?

1205
01:14:35,370 --> 01:14:36,350
You must be in here.

1206
01:14:39,490 --> 01:14:41,110
Just want to make sure nothing spawns in here.

1207
01:14:42,390 --> 01:14:42,970
That's empty.

1208
01:14:47,690 --> 01:14:48,950
Okay, we got dudes in there.

1209
01:14:49,070 --> 01:14:49,550
There's the party.

1210
01:14:54,880 --> 01:14:55,620
Did I look at him?

1211
01:15:02,220 --> 01:15:02,960
Yeah, come at me.

1212
01:15:04,820 --> 01:15:05,600
No, not the kids!

1213
01:15:14,240 --> 01:15:16,820
Dude, if one of these axe people come at me now, I'm dead.

1214
01:15:18,580 --> 01:15:20,000
Actually, I'm not, because they can't come in here.

1215
01:15:33,130 --> 01:15:34,370
I really need a sword.

1216
01:15:45,790 --> 01:15:46,570
Hey, nice.

1217
01:15:48,350 --> 01:15:49,930
They are above me for sure.

1218
01:15:52,830 --> 01:15:54,270
This is mysterious as hell.

1219
01:15:54,390 --> 01:15:55,830
I don't understand this here.

1220
01:16:02,280 --> 01:16:03,060
They're above me.

1221
01:16:15,460 --> 01:16:15,820
Ooh!

1222
01:16:19,480 --> 01:16:21,140
Dude, it sounds like they're coming up behind me!

1223
01:16:23,000 --> 01:16:24,380
I don't like that at all.

1224
01:16:30,720 --> 01:16:31,960
I have to make an EDP here.

1225
01:16:36,840 --> 01:16:37,440
Oh, come on!

1226
01:16:37,840 --> 01:16:38,580
Look me in the eye!

1227
01:16:43,280 --> 01:16:44,060
He doesn't care!

1228
01:16:45,840 --> 01:16:47,120
I looked him straight in the eye.

1229
01:16:49,140 --> 01:16:49,760
Okay, there we go.

1230
01:17:02,080 --> 01:17:05,080
Maybe I'll actually equip this in case I need to use it.

1231
01:17:17,980 --> 01:17:18,340
Clean.

1232
01:17:21,480 --> 01:17:22,800
And they're all empty, right?

1233
01:17:22,880 --> 01:17:24,900
Yeah, I don't think there's any reason I should try to open them.

1234
01:17:30,790 --> 01:17:33,210
Okay, that's the ground floor taken care of.

1235
01:17:33,410 --> 01:17:34,670
Let's clean out the next floor.

1236
01:17:38,970 --> 01:17:40,190
No carrots yet, though.

1237
01:17:40,530 --> 01:17:42,190
And they've been farming all kinds of stuff.

1238
01:17:49,750 --> 01:17:50,490
There he is.

1239
01:17:53,950 --> 01:17:54,930
Oh, what a shot.

1240
01:18:07,440 --> 01:18:08,520
Okay, good.

1241
01:18:11,800 --> 01:18:12,980
Ooh, I see you.

1242
01:18:15,660 --> 01:18:17,140
Whew, nice.

1243
01:18:19,060 --> 01:18:19,700
Library?

1244
01:18:22,400 --> 01:18:23,280
Hey, dude!

1245
01:18:25,420 --> 01:18:26,640
What you got for me?

1246
01:18:28,100 --> 01:18:29,100
Another library?

1247
01:18:35,190 --> 01:18:36,190
They're right in there.

1248
01:18:36,930 --> 01:18:37,610
I think.

1249
01:18:42,570 --> 01:18:44,150
I don't want to get caught in a corner.

1250
01:18:48,810 --> 01:18:49,330
Yeah.

1251
01:18:49,750 --> 01:18:50,110
Yeah.

1252
01:18:52,830 --> 01:18:55,190
Let me make your... Oh, look at that!

1253
01:18:56,770 --> 01:18:58,530
You're having a party!

1254
01:18:59,190 --> 01:19:00,810
Wow, this guy tried to flank me.

1255
01:19:02,370 --> 01:19:03,230
Clever girl.

1256
01:19:06,060 --> 01:19:07,560
Like shooting fish in a barrel.

1257
01:19:08,460 --> 01:19:10,440
Except it's dumbasses in a room.

1258
01:19:11,880 --> 01:19:12,920
How are you this dumb?

1259
01:19:13,000 --> 01:19:13,240
Come on.

1260
01:19:16,580 --> 01:19:17,060
Wow.

1261
01:19:18,200 --> 01:19:18,920
Well, that was nice.

1262
01:19:19,240 --> 01:19:20,560
Took out a lot of the threat there.

1263
01:19:23,620 --> 01:19:25,520
I'm not gonna go up one more level yet.

1264
01:19:29,730 --> 01:19:30,710
Found the dining room.

1265
01:19:32,510 --> 01:19:34,510
Oh no, wait, wait, this is weird.

1266
01:19:36,770 --> 01:19:37,890
Oh, they do a lot of damage!

1267
01:19:45,490 --> 01:19:46,770
We gotta bow this guy quick.

1268
01:19:55,470 --> 01:19:56,370
Oh yeah, yeah!

1269
01:19:57,370 --> 01:19:57,870
Oh!

1270
01:19:58,090 --> 01:19:58,850
Oh my god!

1271
01:19:59,370 --> 01:19:59,950
I'm dead!

1272
01:20:06,810 --> 01:20:08,370
Damn, they hurt a lot.

1273
01:20:09,390 --> 01:20:14,030
And they... They came through the wall.

1274
01:20:15,450 --> 01:20:16,390
Actual bullshit.

1275
01:20:17,610 --> 01:20:18,370
Nah, man.

1276
01:20:19,510 --> 01:20:20,930
They came through the wall.

1277
01:20:21,210 --> 01:20:21,790
That's cheating.

1278
01:20:22,990 --> 01:20:23,430
Uh-oh.

1279
01:20:24,070 --> 01:20:24,430
There's kits.

1280
01:20:25,430 --> 01:20:26,570
And I have no weapons.

1281
01:20:28,370 --> 01:20:29,950
Where the fuck is the hotel?

1282
01:20:33,370 --> 01:20:34,390
Wait, where am I?

1283
01:20:37,380 --> 01:20:38,000
There it is.

1284
01:20:39,040 --> 01:20:41,820
Yeah, burn in righteous fire, bastard.

1285
01:20:43,500 --> 01:20:46,720
Good news is, I died right on the first floor.

1286
01:20:47,620 --> 01:20:48,480
Moving up the stairs.

1287
01:20:50,680 --> 01:20:51,780
Should be easy enough to find.

1288
01:20:51,880 --> 01:20:52,480
It wasn't that bad.

1289
01:20:55,240 --> 01:20:56,900
Man, I need to bring some more armor.

1290
01:20:57,100 --> 01:20:57,800
This is not enough.

1291
01:20:59,620 --> 01:21:02,160
I can't believe I just got, like, two-shotted by these little minions.

1292
01:21:04,880 --> 01:21:09,380
Also, I hit the Vex guy twice with my bow.

1293
01:21:09,620 --> 01:21:11,360
Didn't die from it, even with the fire.

1294
01:21:15,460 --> 01:21:18,420
Hopefully these little bastards are not still here.

1295
01:21:27,720 --> 01:21:28,640
Put that there.

1296
01:21:29,920 --> 01:21:30,240
Yeah.

1297
01:21:33,220 --> 01:21:33,700
Melons?

1298
01:21:33,900 --> 01:21:34,640
No, I don't want that.

1299
01:21:35,520 --> 01:21:36,360
