Flat roof, but with, like, staircases on the side.

3643
04:11:44,360 --> 04:11:47,200
So, like, staircase on this side, like, up like that.

3644
04:11:47,580 --> 04:11:49,560
Staircase here, up like that, and then flat on top.

3645
