3704
04:15:18,430 --> 04:15:22,390
With these great big windows, you know, the dirty windows in a big factory building.

3705
04:15:23,530 --> 04:15:25,030
Like abandoned factory, you know?

3706
04:15:25,130 --> 04:15:26,030
